DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerA comedian takes five shots of
  whiskey in a row and tries to perform an improvised play with sober comed
 ians. What could go wrong?!\nDrunk Theatre is the entirely improvised\, un
 predictable\, and crazy comedy show that’ll kick your weekend into overd
 rive. See what the SF Chronicle\, CBS\, LA Times\, SF Weekly\, SFGate\, Th
 rillist\, and TimeOut have all been talking about.\nNightmare on Valencia 
 St. is our Halloween show! Drunk Theatre is partnering with a special effe
 cts makeup artist (Dani Spinks of Agoreable Designs) to bring real monster
 s to the stage with our drunk comedians.\nWe’re bringing in guest comedi
 ans\, decking them out in monster makeup\, and revealing them live to the 
 cast and audience at the same time—it’ll also be the first time they s
 ee themselves!\nDrunk Theatre SF | Nightmare on Valencia St.\nSaturday Nig
 hts in October\nEclectic Box\, 446 Valencia Street\, SF\nBuy Tickets – S
 tarts at $23.18 adv / $25 door\n\nLine begins at 9:30pm\, Door opens at 9:
 45pm\, show starts at 10:00pm\nLimited ticket availability at the door.\n\
 n*The event is open to all ages\, but the comedy may not be suitable for c
 hildren.\n\n24-hour notice is required for cancelations. Late cancelations
  may be transferred to another show date of your choosing. Seating is firs
 t come\, first serve. Parties later than 15-20 minutes may have their tick
 ets sold at the door.\n\n2026 San Francisco Drunk Theatre Schedule\nOctobe
 r 2026 shows\n\nSaturday\, October 3\, 2026 | 9:30pm – 11:00pm – Get T
 ickets\nSa...\n\n$23.18\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/drunk-the
 atres-nightmare-on-valencia-st-halloween-special-tickets-1999522834624?dis
 count=FUNCHEAP&amp\;aff=FuncheapSponsoredTopPick\nDetails: https://sf.func
 heap.com/sf-drunk-theatre-halloween-special-nightmare-on-valencia-st-oct-3
 /\nSource: Funcheap SF
