CATEGORIES:Comedy Event Types Event
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerEmanuel BruehEnjoy an early ev
 ening of stand-up comedy in the stylish surroundings of The Ameswell Hotel
  in Mountain View.\nThis one-night showcase brings together a fresh lineup
  of Bay Area comedians for a fast-paced show by the fireplace adjacent to 
 ROGER Bar & Restaurant. Each comedian brings a different voice and perspec
 tive\, making this edition a unique mix of established local favorites and
  rising talent.\n\nThe show starts at 6 pm\, making it an easy after-work 
 outing or the beginning of a night out. Guests can arrive early or stay af
 terward for seasonally inspired food\, craft cocktails\, and drinks availa
 ble for purchase from ROGER.\nRather than a traditional comedy-club settin
 g\, the performance takes place inside one of Silicon Valley’s most dist
 inctive boutique hotels\, near NASA Ames and downtown Mountain View.\nEven
 t Details:\n\nAdmission: $25 for two\nShow time: 6 pm\nLocation: ROGER Bar
  & Restaurant at The Ameswell Hotel\nAddress: 800 Moffett Boulevard\, Moun
 tain View\nFood and beverages available for purchase\nAdvance tickets reco
 mmended\n\n$12.51\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/comedy-show-rog
 er-that-tickets-1980041276760?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/comedy-fall-ameswell/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Funche
 ap-Post-1.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:The Ameswell Hotel\, 800 Moffet Blvd.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/comedy-fall-ameswell/
END:VEVENT
