DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMichael AstrauskasPhasers On S
 tun beams into EndGames Improv for Junction of the Stars\, a fully improvi
 sed night of classic sci-fi television. While the USS Enterprise is off in
  another quadrant\, the crew of the USS Golden Gate performs two back-to-b
 ack Star Trek-style episodes created on the spot from audience-suggested t
 itles. No script\, no net\, all fun. Expect strange new worlds\, dubious a
 lien diplomacy\, dramatic red-shirt casualties\, and plenty of laughs. You
  do not need to know Star Trek to enjoy the show\; longtime fans just get 
 a few extra jokes. Shows run about an hour.\n\n$17.35\n\nTickets: https://
 phasersonstunimprov.com/shows\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/phasers-st
 un-improvised-scifi-style-star-trek/\nSource: Funcheap SF
