 imeOut have all been talking about.\nNightmare on Valencia St. is our Hall
 oween show! Drunk Theatre is partnering with a special effects makeup arti
 st (Dani Spinks of Agoreable Designs) to bring real monsters to the stage 
 with our drunk comedians.\nWe’re bringing in guest comedians\, decking t
 hem out in monster makeup\, and revealing them live to the cast and audien
 ce at the same time—it’ll also be the first time they see themselves!\
