DESCRIPTION:SF’s HellaSecret “Crazy Funny Asians” Friday Night Comed
 y Showcase (7p + 9p)\nHellaFunny\nInspired by the blockbuster movie\, see 
 some of the Bay Area’s top comedians at San Francisco’s Crazy Funny As
 ians comedy showcase\, presented by Funcheap and HellaFunny. Let’s celeb
 rate the Bay’s Asian-American culture and heritage with laughs at a secr
 et location – a two-floor comedy club near BART with a full bar\, craft 
 cocktails\, comfy seating and upstairs lounge.\nFree tickets for the first
  50 people to RSVP\nHellaSecret “Crazy Funny Asians” Comedy Showcase\n
 Every Friday & Saturday at 7pm + 9pm\nSecret Location – Near Hayes Valle
 y / Civic Center\, San Francisco\nFREE with RSVP (Donations appreciated 
 – bring cash) – limited to first 50\nTickets\n– FREE with Eventbrite
  RSVP – Donations appreciated – bring cash\n– Maximum Two Comp Ticke
 ts Per Person – If you have additional guests you’d like to bring\, th
 ey must RSVP separately\n– $20 door (without RSVP)\n– Lineup subject t
 o change\n– Admission is first come first served\n– Like most comedy c
 lubs\, there is a two-drink minimum to help support our local bar scene.\n
 Hosted by K. Cheng (NBC’s Stand Up for Diversity\, Khmers of Comedy\, Ho
 st SF Chinese New Year Parade Pre-Show)\nCrazy Funny Asians Comedy Lineup\
 nEvery week is a new lineup. Here are some of our favorites you might see
 …\n\nJeen Yee-Tommy Ts\nChris Posadas-Tommy Ts\nShawn Felipe-WorldAsia T
 V\, Sprint Comedy\nNicole Tran- Tommy T’s\nRyan Chan- Opened for Earthqu
 ake\nMoon Choe- SF Sketchfest\nAndrew Orofolo-SF...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: ht
 tps://www.eventbrite.com/e/hellasecret-crazy-funny-asians-comedy-show-live
 -in-san-francisco-tickets-888006650797?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https:/
 /sf.funcheap.com/sfs-hellasecret-crazy-funny-asians-friday-night-comedy-sh
 owcase-7p-9p-79/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/08/CrazyF
 unnyAsians-e1535334557269.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T001646Z
LOCATION:Secret Location (SF)\, San Francisco\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-hellasecret-crazy-funny-asians-friday-nigh
 t-comedy-showcase-7p-9p-79/
END:VEVENT
