DESCRIPTION:Renowned Clown and Mime artist Dean Evans presents a series of
  darkly comedic personas\, one after another\, in a tour de force of physi
 cal transformation. Dean slips between an Edgar Allan Poe–esque horror w
 riter\, a retired showgirl from Branson Missouri\, a dying Mime gasping ou
 t one last performance\, and an entity simply known as "Slime Rat" and mor
 e. Evans takes us on a tour of the dark recesses of their clown brain in t
 his hour long perverse Spoon River Anthology.\nCreated & Performed by Dean
  Evans.\n\nArtist Bio\nDean Evans is an award-winning performer\, director
 \, and master physical theater artist. Named one of the top 50 ‘players
 ’ by New City magazine Dean tours internationally as a solo artist and h
 as performed professionally with the Second City\, iO\, the Goodman\, Cirq
 ue du Soleil and more. Dean was an ensemble member of the iconic performan
 ce art troop the Neo-Futurists in Chicago. Dean has directed many troops i
 ncluding Slowdance\, iL Fungo. the Nonsemble\, and Mil Grus who had an off
 -broadway run in NYC in 2019. Dean’s alter ego\, Honeybuns\, has enjoyed
  their own career performing in NYC\, Chicago\, Moscow\, Ireland\, Austin\
 , Boston\, Portland and Los Angeles. Dean has created over a dozen full-le
 ngth theatrical productions\, 3 full-length circuses\, and dozens of comed
 ic characters. They have appeared on NBC\, AMC\, TBS\, Netflix\, The Onion
 \, and Russia’s минута славы. Dean also writes & directs real
 ly cool films.\n\n$20 - $40\, NOTAFLOF\n\nTickets: https://www.zeffy.com/e
 n-US/ticketing/dean-evans-les-pervers-flop-festival--2026\nDetails: https:
 //dothebay.com/events/2026/10/17/dean-evans-les-pervers-flop-fest-tickets\
 nSource: DoTheBay
