  ⚡\nGreat Scott! Value Culture’s Boom Boom Comedy Showcase is going ba
 ck to the future for a special night of comedy\, nostalgia\, and 1980s tim
 e-travel magic at San Francisco’s legendary Boom Boom Room.\nSpecial App
 earance: Claudia Wells\, best known as Jennifer Parker in the original Bac
 k to the Future\, joins us for the evening. Meet Claudia during a special 
 autograph signing at 7 PM\, followed by the comedy show at 8 PM.\n\nFeatur
 ing comedians Stephanie Block\, Adam Swig\, Paul Robertson\, Kaseem Bentle
 y + special guests\, with more surprises to be announced.\nWednesday\, Oct
 ober 21\, 2026\n7 PM — Claudia Wells Autograph Signing (Experiences can 
 be purchased upon arrival)\n8 PM — Comedy Showcase (3rd Wednesdays at th
 e BBR)\nBoom Boom Room — 1601 Fillmore St.\, San Francisco\n21+\nEnjoy Y
 erdrink (Sparkling Yerba Mate & Coconut Water) Specials all night.\n️ FR
 EE with RSVP\nPresented by Value Culture and The Boom Boom Room\nFire up t
 he flux capacitor\, grab your friends\, and Laugh to the Future. ⚡\nThe 
 mission of Value Culture is to produce and support artistic\, educational\
 , charitable\, and spiritual events to inspire individuals to give back to
  their communities. Value Culture removes barriers to arts\, culture\, and
  philanthropy. Contact us @ivalueculture\nWe encourage all those drinking 
 alcohol to not...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://backtothefutureday.eventbrit
 e.com\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/future-day-comedy-show-claudia-wel
